Package: tcspecial-test
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: David VomLehn <dvomlehn@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS@, tcspecial (= @VERSION@)
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcspecial
Description: tcspecial's test ground station and payload simulator
 tcsmoc, a test mission operations center with a window per payload, and
 tcssim, which stands in for the payloads a configuration describes. tcsmoc
 starts the tcspecial installed beside it and tcssim, both with the
 simulation mode it was given. Also the test segsend, which deletes each
 filled telemetry log segment it is given. Test software, never flown.
 Everything is under /opt/tcs. /etc/profile.d/tcspecial-test.sh puts
 /opt/tcs/bin on a login shell's search path, and
 /opt/tcs/sbin/tcspecial-test-links links the programs into /usr/local/bin
 for everything else.
